/-!
# Heavy leaf `hs4_floor_box`: the four auxiliary bounds of the `β`-step

On `x ∈ [2, 13/6]`, `α ∈ [1, 22/19]`, `u ∈ [757/1000, 19/25]`: `k_Φ, k_I, k_II ≥ 1/15` and `L_u ≥ -13/20`
(all four are affine in `u`; at each end of the `u`-interval, the cleared numerator is positive by
a small Bernstein certificate; generated by `scripts/certificates/short-hand/hh46/s4claims.py`).

## Main API

`hh46S4kPhi`, `hh46S4tE`, `hh46S4kI`, `hh46S4kII`, `hh46S4Lu`, `hh46_s4_kPhi_ge`, `hh46_s4_kI_ge`, `hh46_s4_kII_ge`, `hh46_s4_Lu_ge`.
-/

@[expose] public section

